module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.witnesses_red_on_main_with_no_failure_mode_row

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode, RungRead, FoundOnRung, BelowCeiling }
import gunbc.guarantee_rung { Mitigatable, StructurallyGuaranteed }
import gunbc.rung_climb { ClimbableButUnbuilt }

data witnesses_red_on_main_with_no_failure_mode_row: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "witnesses_red_on_main_with_no_failure_mode_row" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungRead {
    found_at: FoundOnRung { rung: Mitigatable },
    standing: BelowCeiling {
      current: FoundOnRung { rung: Mitigatable },
      ceiling: StructurallyGuaranteed,
      blocker: ClimbableButUnbuilt,
      trigger_capability: "an instrument label whose run executes the witness population and states, per identity, whether it is green at the default branch head and whether the required path runs it",
    },
  },

  receipts: [
    "**a witness red at origin/main has no row, so every PR that touches its module rediscovers and re-attributes it** (INVALID STATE: a committed witness fails under `gunbc run --claim-run` at the default branch head and nothing records that, which test, or whether the required path runs it).",

    "HARM: each lane has to re-measure the failure against main to show it is not its own, and a lane that skips the comparison either blames itself or absorbs the red. SPECIMEN (gunbc#14384, main 6ae9b3b9591, executed with `gunbc run --source-root dag --source-root src/v2 --entry <witness> --claim-run`): test.claim.rung_drop_superseded_standing_witness the_live_roster_loss_holders_resolve_and_stand; test.claim.compiler_frontend_program_status_witness every_declared_instrument_is_distinct_and_awaited; test.claim.exact_witness_admission_witness no_batch_mixes_a_pre_verdict_row_with_an_assertion_false_row and both_red_expectations_are_known_red_but_only_one_expects_a_pre_verdict_refusal. Whether any of the four is on the required path was not established by that lane.",

    "SPECIMEN, MECHANISM (D13, main 1acf79a8af4c, remote `claim_batch --claim-run` of v2.test.claim.compiler.dependency_demand_census with a probe printing `demand_census_row_line` per row): 14 of 22 claims FAIL on main, among them demand_through_a_transparent_callee_is_equal_holds, and the eight that pass are partly vacuous (their expected verdict is unobserved). THE REDUCER NEVER RAN, and a chain of unjustified links hid it, each behind the one before. LINK 1, STALE FIXTURE, FIXED: ddc_ingest omitted std.types while every fixture source imports `std.types { Bool }`, so 13 of 15 rows read unobserved resolve_module_not_found; the real std.types imports std.algebra, a world the fixture cannot supply, so the ingest carries a stub declaring `type Bool = True | False` exactly as dag/std/types.dag does. LINK 2, CENSUS DEFECT, FIXED: demand_census_authored_reading resolved a TYPE expression under the module-root value-category context, so since #14090 every `uses net: Network` was reference_category_mismatch, collapsed with three other arms into AuthoredTypeUnresolved; it now resolves under resolve_ctx_with_reference_category(TypeOccurrence) (v2.compiler.resolve unchanged; no other type-expression resolve_node site exists). LINK 3, CENSUS DEFECT, FIXED: since #14209 every list introduction heads with a generated reference to std.algebra.FreeMonoid and demand_fact_node counted it as a callee (callee_outside_closure at FreeMonoid); a list introduction is not a call, recognised by v2.std.list_introduction list_introduction_elements_optional, the reader eval uses. LINK 4, OPEN: service operations (t.http.H.Get, Exec, Ping) are not read as operations, so the derived vocabulary is empty, every Network row reads out_of_vocabulary and every service call reads callee_outside_closure; stale fixture versus lowering drift is not yet decided. REASON COLLAPSE, OPEN: the four AuthoredTypeUnresolved arms (shell absent, lowering absent, resolve rejected, no declaration path) still print one cause; carrying resolve's reason in the row hit a closure-diagnostics cascade in which the record DemandCensusRow was erased to T (no field 'standings' on type 'T'), not yet reduced. AFTER LINKS 1-3, 12 PASS / 10 FAIL. PASS: every_uses_fn_gets_exactly_one_census_row_holds, a_body_naming_its_uses_alias_stays_unobserved_until_resolve_binds_it_holds, duplicate_uses_aliases_leave_the_fn_unobserved_RED, production_lowering_of_the_same_fns_still_refuses_at_the_clause_holds, a_call_through_a_function_value_is_undecided_on_the_real_route_RED, a_call_through_a_function_parameter_is_undecided_on_the_real_route_RED, a_uses_file_refused_before_authorship_is_an_incomplete_population_RED, a_consumer_of_a_file_refused_module_is_told_the_importee_was_refused_RED, a_genuinely_missing_name_still_reports_unbound_holds, a_shaped_unbound_names_std_algebra_freemonoid_RED, a_different_shaped_ref_renders_differently_holds, a_shaped_unbound_without_a_path_renders_kind_RED. FAIL, all link 4 (service operations unread; Network row out_of_vocabulary, service callee outside closure): a_row_restating_a_called_network_operation_is_equal_holds, demand_through_a_transparent_callee_is_equal_holds, a_row_claiming_network_the_body_never_reaches_is_a_mismatch_RED, a_service_call_without_requires_network_does_not_derive_network_RED, reaching_an_opaque_operation_is_undecided_by_that_cause_RED, a_qualified_member_sharing_the_alias_spelling_is_not_substituted_RED, a_let_binder_sharing_the_alias_spelling_is_not_substituted_RED (let_shadows reads equal, out_of_vocabulary), only_equal_network_rows_are_deletable_and_filesystem_is_counted_apart_holds, a_mixed_fn_licenses_only_its_in_vocabulary_row_RED. The tenth FAIL line is the removed probe. Classification at claim identity: link 1 stale fixture, links 2-3 genuine census defects, link 4 undecided, never environment-blocked. The dependency_demand.dag reducer claims (10) were not run in this PR.",

    "RUNG FOUND AT 1, mitigatable: the red is visible to whoever runs the witness and to no gate. CEILING 3, structurally guaranteed for the enrolled population: a witness on the required path cannot be red at main because the merge queue refuses it; the unenrolled remainder is a ratchet.",

    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, NAMING THE CAPABILITY: an instrument label whose run executes the witness population and states, per identity, whether it is green at the default branch head and whether the required path runs it. SUFFICIENT FOR: the four specimens above being counted, or shown absent, by that run rather than by this row.",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: a red you did not cause is a fact about main, not about your lane. Run the same witness at origin/main, cite the sha, and check this ledger before attributing it.",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
